# ML Classification: Knots & Flower Beams

This repository provides a complete pipeline for generating, training, and evaluating machine‑learning classifiers on 3D optical knot fields and 2D spectral (flower beam) data. You’ll find scripts and notebooks for data generation, model training, and evaluation, as well as a collection of pre‑trained models.

---

